{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Validate the required invoke function name.** `{ FunctionName: undefined }` passes this container-only check even though `FunctionName` is required by the wire model. The local runner then rejects later with a plain orchestrator error, whereas Lambda rejects the checkpoint with HTTP 400 and fails the execution. Validate `ChainedInvokeOptions.FunctionName` during model validation and add an integration case.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-Pjqm","finding_digest":"c18e10a69b7882a13f35127015292fe1531680b54c6f26be5212c69050950997","finding_id":"arf_v1_yghbbju3pcbkcpzvcjybkkjp4f","finding_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-chained-invoke-operation::required-function-name-validation","identity_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-chained-invoke-operation::required-function-name-validation","line":30,"observation_digest":"dc1ef3901ff4614878b2515bb6ef5ed4af4be56106f64d4d8cdf43cb6f88f3a1","observation_id":"aro_v1_3qpphea76rquq6fskfn3n3262s","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/checkpoint-server/validators/operation-type/validate-chained-invoke-operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T00:24:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tkxylvrdzjqtazj2ldos7rsxjo","reviewed_base_sha":"08ba0f6e29d7faaaaa99a6acde407db9c9854e2f","reviewed_head_sha":"cccd27ff243bf4350b7acb2356ce91c215961010","reviewer":"codex","start_line":30,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":996},"record_id":"art_v1_zpn5d5qo6dael634linjfwyptt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T00:24:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
